# Trivy ignore file for munisp/corebanking
# Format: CVE-ID  # reason  (expiry: YYYY-MM-DD)
#
# Add CVEs here ONLY after documented risk acceptance with a time-bound expiry.
# All entries MUST include a reason and expiry date.
# Entries without an expiry date will be rejected in code review.
#
